# Issue 1331 slice 4: the duty and yard rows the client reaches, from CampActionsTests.Stocked (a camp before
# Sallow Grange with 5000, common material 4, the captain at L3, Teodor at L4): a forge duty's free step,
# a rest, then Wren drilled under the captain in the sword (the captain swings at the soldier and
# misses, Wren falls to the brigand on turn 2), left, then the march.
build forge
duty teodor forge 1 mt
duty maud rest
yard captain wren sword
end !
move captain 3,5
attack captain soldier-1 1
attack wren soldier-1 1
end !
leave
march
